{
"file": 202,
"paths": [
"d007/d008/f157"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "42d91cd1",
"en_raw": "...Hiroshi Yoshii?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "353c89f8",
"en_raw": "Who's Hiroshi Yoshii"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "f9b839c8",
"en_raw": "Yuri?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "fa598b53",
"en_raw": "That name"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "fe20d25c",
"en_raw": "you shouldn't say it much..."
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "7c541a48",
"en_raw": "It's an accursed grudge"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "583ab138",
"en_raw": "Grudge...?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "5141375a",
"en_raw": "That person failed his entrance exams"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "e8d42920",
"en_raw": "and tried to kill himself"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "c2e3f3ba",
"en_raw": "He jumped into a crossing at midnight..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "9a50612a",
"en_raw": "But when the train was right in front of him"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "719578f0",
"en_raw": "he changed his mind and ran"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "3cd9207a",
"en_raw": "The train grazed him but"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "2851ce02",
"en_raw": "miraculously he survived"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "1dbf785f",
"en_raw": "For that moment..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "12867d35",
"en_raw": "But thrown onto the tracks"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "1e5514e1",
"en_raw": "when he looked at his body..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "68983ac7",
"en_raw": "both legs were gone!"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "3390cb0e",
"en_raw": "Eek..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "b228ebca",
"en_raw": "And as he dragged his legless body"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "9d777303",
"en_raw": "to escape the tracks"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "8955e0b1",
"en_raw": "a train from the other direction..."
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "adcbd35d",
"en_raw": "So that crossing's"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "8008dcdf",
"en_raw": "grudge...?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "0ff24ec9",
"en_raw": "Right..."
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "71e13712",
"en_raw": "Hey, how did you"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "c5d63719",
"en_raw": "know all that?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "3170c6cc",
"en_raw": "Lord Tsukuyomi told me"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "caaeb40f",
"en_raw": "about it"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "eefc1135",
"en_raw": "There was such a story..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "6a5d1706",
"en_raw": "Yuri really is amazing"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "fad9ff10",
"en_raw": "The otaku girl is eavesdropping again"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "5b80ad41",
"en_raw": "Day after day, never getting tired of"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "903e85fa",
"en_raw": "badmouthing or ghost stories..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "0eb0ce6a",
"en_raw": "I'd like to see"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "021dd29b",
"en_raw": "what kind of structure"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "e6134344",
"en_raw": "her brain has, just once"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "dc8b9664",
"en_raw": "Yeah, Lord Tsukuyomi is the best"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "9368197c",
"en_raw": "...just kidding"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "bf84bfab",
"en_raw": "Need something?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "ff3b3a42",
"en_raw": "I don't intend to interfere with"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "81ab8dfd",
"en_raw": "the Iwase Cult's missionary work"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "5eec09e4",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi, you"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "50278d32",
"en_raw": "have rubbed me wrong for a while..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "13fa981e",
"en_raw": "Oh, really, the feeling's mutual"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "1bbc5375",
"en_raw": "...I can't stand it today"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "dfb1add5",
"en_raw": "If you don't believe it that much"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "3b9d2a6e",
"en_raw": "try what I tell you"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "36340f8e",
"en_raw": "Well, if you have"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "cec1f921",
"en_raw": "the courage, that is"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "7b230719",
"en_raw": "It won't hurt or anything"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "dc11df25",
"en_raw": "Just chant the spell three times at the crossing"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "483338cc",
"en_raw": "...The White Suicide Note"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "399a7ab3",
"en_raw": "You'll definitely regret"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "984ee71e",
"en_raw": "that curse"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "8d739552",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the White Suicide Note"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "d3b524e4",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sakai, the more witnesses"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "25ca7a6f",
"en_raw": "the better, right?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "7022aaec",
"en_raw": "True, I'll come watch too"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "d04f46ec",
"en_raw": "Then, 7 o'clock at the Crossing Jizo"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "60d1c283",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi, if you're going to run"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "6da90976",
"en_raw": "now's the time"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "55114acb",
"en_raw": "What you said earlier..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "b0dd1a7d",
"en_raw": "What did you say"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "a0fedab7",
"en_raw": "to me?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "b82d83df",
"en_raw": "That you're all talk"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "4a50caea",
"en_raw": "...If you're upset"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "ef7e8039",
"en_raw": "want to try what I told you?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "367dd2aa",
"en_raw": "Sorry for the interruption~"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "de36b96b",
"en_raw": "Where was the promised place again?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "14513650",
"en_raw": "The crossing, you know: cross-ing"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "a05880ad",
"en_raw": "If you don't come at 7"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "e8dd37d3",
"en_raw": "we'll consider it running away"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "0102dc6d",
"en_raw": "Stay away if you've no business"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "dff2c759",
"en_raw": "...You can't do it, right?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "31a4d113",
"en_raw": "You're all talk"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "d70a7628",
"en_raw": "Oh, sorry"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "6072d73c",
"en_raw": "It's a waste of time after all"
}
]
}